Updated loadPreview() in [section]/page.tsx to detect when d.goal is an object and extract .statement:
  const rawGoal = d.goal;
  const goalString =
    rawGoal !== null && typeof rawGoal === 'object' && !Array.isArray(rawGoal)
      ? ((rawGoal as Record<string, unknown>).statement as string | undefined)
      : (rawGoal as string | undefined);
Also created wiki-app/components/views/BugView.tsx for a readable, styled bug-report page (previously rendered as raw JSON).
